! Fractal Background Plugin

This plugin provides an ambient WebGL fractal background that renders stellar nebula animations behind all content.

!! Features

* WebGL-based stellar nebula shader
* Automatic pause when tab/window loses focus
* Performance-optimized rendering
* Intensity control via tiddler state
* Non-intrusive, ambient-only rendering

!! Usage

The fractal background automatically activates when the theme is loaded. To control intensity, set the tiddler:

```
$:/plugins/awildsort/fractal-background/intensity
```

Value should be between 0.0 and 1.0 (default: 0.4).

!! Controls

The background automatically pauses when:
* The browser tab loses focus
* The window is minimized
* The page is hidden

This prevents unnecessary CPU/GPU usage when the page isn't visible.


